# Action-version audit output. Written into the repo root by
# scripts/audit_action_versions.py on every run, the same way ruff_check_out.txt
# and ruff_errors.json were -- committed scan output that reads as source.
ACTION_AUDIT.md
action-audit.json

# Probe scratch dirs. `TemporaryDirectory` removes these on any normal exit or
# exception; one only survives a SIGKILL (a cancelled CI job, a reclaimed
# runner). `_sweep_stale_probes()` clears them at the start of the next probe,
# but they are ignored here too so a killed run can never leave a deliberately
# tangled probe file staged for commit.
immune-probe-*/

# Antibody audit trail — one line per run, written wherever the tool is invoked.
# Machine-local by nature (it records what a particular run refused on a
# particular tree), so it is not carried in git; CI uploads it as an artifact.
logs/antibody.jsonl
